    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "main",
      "attrs": {
        "id": "main",
        "tabindex": "-1"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero",
            "style": "min-height:auto; padding-top:60px;"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "AI-personalized audio · Solo or duo · Adults 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "page-title"
              },
              "html": "Your intimate audio. <br>\n<em>Your names. Your preferences.</em>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-sub"
              },
              "html": "A prerecorded story stays the same for everyone who listens. Caresse creates guided audio fiction from your configuration: chosen names, solo or duo mode, atmosphere and the preferences available in the app."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "store-controls"
              },
              "html": "\n<div class=\"cta-group\">\n<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download now</a>\n</div>\n"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Free demos · No Caresse account · Personalized sessions with paid credits, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "intent"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "What changes between a demo and your session"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "A demo lets you hear the synthetic voice and discover the format before paying. Its names and choices are fixed in advance; it does not use your profile."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "In a personalized session, your configuration informs the narrative. Your chosen names or nicknames can be spoken aloud, and suggestions are shaped by the preferences you select. The result is guided audio to listen to, with no written replies required to advance."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "diff"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title",
                "id": "configuration-title"
              },
              "html": "From your choices to a generated audio experience"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "diff-table-wrap"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "diff-table",
                    "aria-labelledby": "configuration-title"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Chosen names</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Alex and Sam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mode</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">Duo, or solo with one profile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Atmosphere</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">A calm, romantic moment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preferences</td>\n<td class=\"highlight\">The options you have agreed on together</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "intent-prose",
                "style": "max-width:900px;margin:32px auto 0;"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "In this example, the narrative is created for Alex and Sam and the atmosphere they choose. Changing names, selecting solo mode or choosing different preferences changes the information used for generation."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "This configuration example is not a transcript of a promised session. AI can produce variations or inconsistencies; it does not guarantee exact wording, a fixed duration or the absence of repetition."
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "figure",
                  "attrs": {
                    "style": "max-width:260px;margin:32px auto 0;text-align:center;"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<img src=\"/screens/en/05_android_en.webp\" alt=\"Caresse screen for choosing solo or duo mode and participant names\" width=\"1179\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:24px;\">\n<figcaption style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.6;\">Illustrative participant configuration screen in English. The names shown belong to this interface example.</figcaption>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "how"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Create audio around your preferences"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "steps-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</div>\n<h3>Try a demo</h3>\n<p>Download Caresse free to hear the format. You can try it without creating a Caresse account.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n<h3>Configure your profiles</h3>\n<p>Use first names or nicknames, choose your mode and select the options that interest you. In duo mode, review them together.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "step-item"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<div class=\"num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</div>\n<h3>Start generation</h3>\n<p>A paid credit starts generation. Once the audio is ready, a synthetic voice guides you through a session created from your setup.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "What personalization means in practice"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefits-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Names in the narration</h3>\n<p>Choose how the participants are named. A nickname is enough; you do not need to give your real identity to have a name spoken aloud.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>Atmosphere and preferences</h3>\n<p>Intensity, mood and selected practices shape the session. Some additional choices may require a separate customization unlock.</p>\n"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "benefit-card"
                  },
                  "html": "\n<h3>An experience open to everyone</h3>\n<p>Solo or together, Caresse welcomes adults of all genders and sexual orientations. In duo mode, every activity requires free, mutual consent throughout the experience. Consent can be withdrawn at any time.</p>\n"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq",
            "aria-labelledby": "faq-title"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "id": "faq-title",
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Your questions, answered."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is it just a name inserted into a recording?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "The session is generated from the configuration and narrated with a synthetic voice. It is not simply a fixed demo with a first name inserted. The result depends on the choices provided and can vary."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Can I create a solo session?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Solo mode uses one profile and your chosen name or nickname. Duo mode lets you configure two participants. Select the options that fit your situation."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Can I request an exact duration?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. The length depends on the generated content and varies between sessions. The app does not offer an exact duration setting."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Do I need a Caresse account to buy credits?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "No. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse without creating a Caresse account. Purchases still require your Apple or Google account and its payment method on the store you use."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Which audio languages are available?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Caresse generates audio sessions in French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. Demos are in French, English and Spanish. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
